From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:02:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: stmmac: dwmac-sun8i: largest frame of 16382 bytes

With FRM_LEN_CTL set, the H616 manual allows frames of up to 16384
bytes. In MAC loopback, QinQ frames of 16380 to 16382 bytes (with FCS)
come back intact. A 16383-byte frame leaves the transmitter but the
receiver flags it with RDES0 bit 4 (RX_LENGTH_ERR) and it is discarded;
a 16384-byte frame is cut by the transmitter (TX length error) and
arrives with a CRC error. RX_FRM_LEN in RDES0 is 14 bits wide.

Take 16382 bytes as the largest frame, so the maximum MTU is 16356 (two
VLAN tags and the FCS included).

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/dwmac-sun8i.c | 13 ++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/dwmac-sun8i.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/dwmac-sun8i.c
index f785dc0..e34fcbd 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/dwmac-sun8i.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/dwmac-sun8i.c
@@ -254,13 +254,16 @@ static const struct emac_variant emac_variant_h6 = {
 #define EMAC_TX_TRANSMITTER_EN  BIT(31)
 #define EMAC_TX_FRM_LEN_CTL	BIT(30)
 
-/* With FRM_LEN_CTL, frames of up to 16384 bytes (else 10240). In
- * store-and-forward mode a frame larger than the 4 KiB TX FIFO starts once
- * the FIFO is full; the DMA then has to keep up with the line, which at
- * 1 Gbit/s takes bursts of at least 16 words.
+/* With FRM_LEN_CTL, frames of up to 16384 bytes (else 10240). The
+ * receiver flags a 16383-byte frame (with FCS) with RX_LENGTH_ERR (RDES0
+ * bit 4) and the transmitter cuts a 16384-byte one, so the largest frame
+ * both ends handle is 16382 bytes. In store-and-forward mode a frame larger
+ * than the 4 KiB TX FIFO starts once the FIFO is full; the DMA then has to
+ * keep up with the line, which at 1 Gbit/s takes bursts of at least 16
+ * words.
  */
 #define EMAC_TX_FIFO_SIZE	4096
-#define EMAC_MAX_FRAME_LEN	16384
+#define EMAC_MAX_FRAME_LEN	16382
 #define EMAC_MAX_MTU(len)	((len) - ETH_HLEN - 2 * VLAN_HLEN - ETH_FCS_LEN)
 #define EMAC_JUMBO_MIN_BURSTLEN	16
 
